{"unit_id":"tag:024S:prose-0003","translation":"\n\n<STRUCT_0001>\n前述定理让我们对非分歧（unramified）态射（morphisms）的“刚性（rigidity）”有了一些认识。下面的命题给出进一步的说明；它不仅本身有趣，而且在代数基本（algebraic fundamental）群（group）理论中也很有用（见<REF_0001>）。还可参见更一般的《态射（Morphisms）》篇，引理<REF_0002>。\n\n","allowed_english":[],"term_occurrences":[{"source_term":"unramified","target_term":"非分歧"},{"source_term":"morphisms","target_term":"态射"},{"source_term":"rigidity","target_term":"刚性"},{"source_term":"algebraic fundamental","target_term":"代数基本"},{"source_term":"group","target_term":"群"},{"source_term":"Morphisms","target_term":"态射"}],"unknown_terms":[{"source_term":"unramified","target_term":"非分歧","context":"本段态射的性质；暂定待决。"},{"source_term":"morphisms","target_term":"态射","context":"刚性所指对象；暂定待决。"},{"source_term":"rigidity","target_term":"刚性","context":"原文引号内的性质；暂定待决。"},{"source_term":"algebraic fundamental","target_term":"代数基本","context":"群的限定语；暂定待决。"},{"source_term":"group","target_term":"群","context":"代数基本群理论；暂定待决。"},{"source_term":"Morphisms","target_term":"态射","context":"引用篇名；暂定待决。"}],"notes":[]}
{"unit_id":"tag:024V:statement","translation":"设<MATH_0001>为概形（scheme）。设<MATH_0002>非分歧（unramified）且分离（separated）。设<MATH_0003>为<MATH_0004>概形（scheme），并设<MATH_0005>为一点。设<MATH_0006>为两个<MATH_0007>态射（morphisms）。假定\n<STRUCT_0001>\n<STRUCT_0002><MATH_0008>连通（connected）；\n<STRUCT_0003><MATH_0009>；\n<STRUCT_0004>诱导的映射（maps）<MATH_0010>在剩余域（residue fields）上相等。\n<STRUCT_0005>\n则<MATH_0011>。\n","allowed_english":[],"term_occurrences":[{"source_term":"scheme","target_term":"概形"},{"source_term":"unramified","target_term":"非分歧"},{"source_term":"separated","target_term":"分离"},{"source_term":"scheme","target_term":"概形"},{"source_term":"morphisms","target_term":"态射"},{"source_term":"connected","target_term":"连通"},{"source_term":"maps","target_term":"映射"},{"source_term":"residue fields","target_term":"剩余域"}],"unknown_terms":[{"source_term":"scheme","target_term":"概形","context":"底和源概形；暂定待决。"},{"source_term":"unramified","target_term":"非分歧","context":"结构态射条件；暂定待决。"},{"source_term":"separated","target_term":"分离","context":"结构态射条件；暂定待决。"},{"source_term":"morphisms","target_term":"态射","context":"待比较的两个态射；暂定待决。"},{"source_term":"connected","target_term":"连通","context":"源概形；暂定待决。"},{"source_term":"maps","target_term":"映射","context":"剩余域上的诱导映射；暂定待决。"},{"source_term":"residue fields","target_term":"剩余域","context":"指定点的剩余域；暂定待决。"}],"notes":["Source-only remark: the opening contains 'is be'. The stated mathematical hypothesis is retained."]}
{"unit_id":"tag:024V:proof","translation":"映射（maps）<MATH_0001>定义了映射（maps）<MATH_0002>，它们是结构映射（map）<MATH_0003>的截面（sections）。注意到<MATH_0004>当且仅当<MATH_0005>。结构映射（map）<MATH_0006>是<MATH_0007>的基变换（base change），因此也非分歧（unramified）且分离（separated）（见《态射（Morphisms）》篇，引理<REF_0001>和《概形（Schemes）》篇，引理<REF_0002>）。于是，按照定理<REF_0003>，只需证明<MATH_0008>和<MATH_0009>经过<MATH_0010>的同一点。而条件(2)和(3)恰好保证这一点，即<MATH_0011>。\n","allowed_english":[],"term_occurrences":[{"source_term":"maps","target_term":"映射"},{"source_term":"maps","target_term":"映射"},{"source_term":"map","target_term":"结构映射"},{"source_term":"sections","target_term":"截面"},{"source_term":"map","target_term":"结构映射"},{"source_term":"base change","target_term":"基变换"},{"source_term":"unramified","target_term":"非分歧"},{"source_term":"separated","target_term":"分离"},{"source_term":"Morphisms","target_term":"态射"},{"source_term":"Schemes","target_term":"概形"}],"unknown_terms":[{"source_term":"maps","target_term":"映射","context":"原映射和基变换后的映射；暂定待决。"},{"source_term":"map","target_term":"结构映射","context":"基变换前后的结构映射；暂定待决。"},{"source_term":"sections","target_term":"截面","context":"比较两个截面；暂定待决。"},{"source_term":"base change","target_term":"基变换","context":"保持非分歧与分离；暂定待决。"},{"source_term":"unramified","target_term":"非分歧","context":"结构映射性质；暂定待决。"},{"source_term":"separated","target_term":"分离","context":"结构映射性质；暂定待决。"},{"source_term":"Morphisms","target_term":"态射","context":"引用篇名；暂定待决。"},{"source_term":"Schemes","target_term":"概形","context":"引用篇名；暂定待决。"}],"notes":[]}
{"unit_id":"tag:0AKI:statement","translation":"设<MATH_0001>为诺特概形（Noetherian scheme）。设<MATH_0002>为拟紧（quasi-compact）非分歧（unramified）态射（morphism）。设<MATH_0003>为态射（morphism），且<MATH_0004>为诺特（Noetherian）。则<MATH_0005>为有限集（finite set）。\n","allowed_english":[],"term_occurrences":[{"source_term":"Noetherian scheme","target_term":"诺特概形"},{"source_term":"quasi-compact","target_term":"拟紧"},{"source_term":"unramified","target_term":"非分歧"},{"source_term":"morphism","target_term":"态射"},{"source_term":"morphism","target_term":"态射"},{"source_term":"Noetherian","target_term":"诺特"},{"source_term":"finite set","target_term":"有限集"}],"unknown_terms":[{"source_term":"Noetherian scheme","target_term":"诺特概形","context":"底概形条件；暂定待决。"},{"source_term":"quasi-compact","target_term":"拟紧","context":"第一个态射条件；暂定待决。"},{"source_term":"unramified","target_term":"非分歧","context":"第一个态射条件；暂定待决。"},{"source_term":"morphism","target_term":"态射","context":"底上的态射；暂定待决。"},{"source_term":"Noetherian","target_term":"诺特","context":"测试概形条件；暂定待决。"},{"source_term":"finite set","target_term":"有限集","context":"态射集合的结论；暂定待决。"}],"notes":[]}
{"unit_id":"tag:0AKI:proof","translation":"先假定<MATH_0001>分离（separated）（实际中常常如此）。由于<MATH_0002>为诺特（Noetherian），它有有限多个连通分支（connected components）。因此可假定<MATH_0003>连通（connected）。取一点<MATH_0004>，其像（image）为<MATH_0005>。由于<MATH_0006>非分歧（unramified）且拟紧（quasi-compact），纤维（fibre）<MATH_0007>是有限的（finite），设<MATH_0008>，并且<MATH_0009>是有限（finite）域（field）扩张（extension）。见《态射（Morphisms）》篇，引理<REF_0001>、<REF_0002>和<REF_0003>。对每个<MATH_0010>，至多有有限多个<MATH_0011>代数（algebra）映射（maps）<MATH_0012>（由初等域（field）论）。所以由命题<REF_0004>，<MATH_0013>是有限的（finite）。\n\n<STRUCT_0001><STRUCT_0002>\n一般情形。存在非空开集（nonempty open）<MATH_0014>，使得<MATH_0015>是有限的（finite）（特别地，分离（separated）），见《态射（Morphisms）》篇，引理<REF_0005>（该引理适用，因为我们已经在上面看到，拟紧（quasi-compact）非分歧（unramified）态射（morphism）是拟有限（quasi-finite）的，并且由《态射（Morphisms）》篇，引理<REF_0006>，<MATH_0016>拟分离（quasi-separated））。令<MATH_0017>为支撑在<MATH_0018>的补集（complement）上的约化（reduced）闭子概形（closed subscheme）。由诺特（Noetherian）归纳法（induction），可知<MATH_0019>是有限的（finite）（细节略）。由第一段的结果，集合（set）<MATH_0020>是有限的（finite）。因此只需证明<MATH_0021>为单射（injective）。这是因为点的集合（set），即两个态射（morphisms）<MATH_0022>相等的那些点，在<MATH_0023>中是开（open）的；而这又是由于<MATH_0024>是开（open）的，见《态射（Morphisms）》篇，引理<REF_0007>。\n","allowed_english":[],"term_occurrences":[{"source_term":"separated","target_term":"分离"},{"source_term":"Noetherian","target_term":"诺特"},{"source_term":"connected components","target_term":"连通分支"},{"source_term":"connected","target_term":"连通"},{"source_term":"image","target_term":"像"},{"source_term":"unramified","target_term":"非分歧"},{"source_term":"quasi-compact","target_term":"拟紧"},{"source_term":"fibre","target_term":"纤维"},{"source_term":"finite","target_term":"有限的"},{"source_term":"finite","target_term":"有限"},{"source_term":"field","target_term":"域"},{"source_term":"extension","target_term":"扩张"},{"source_term":"Morphisms","target_term":"态射"},{"source_term":"algebra","target_term":"代数"},{"source_term":"maps","target_term":"映射"},{"source_term":"field","target_term":"域"},{"source_term":"finite","target_term":"有限的"},{"source_term":"nonempty open","target_term":"非空开集"},{"source_term":"finite","target_term":"有限的"},{"source_term":"separated","target_term":"分离"},{"source_term":"Morphisms","target_term":"态射"},{"source_term":"quasi-compact","target_term":"拟紧"},{"source_term":"unramified","target_term":"非分歧"},{"source_term":"morphism","target_term":"态射"},{"source_term":"quasi-finite","target_term":"拟有限"},{"source_term":"Morphisms","target_term":"态射"},{"source_term":"quasi-separated","target_term":"拟分离"},{"source_term":"complement","target_term":"补集"},{"source_term":"reduced","target_term":"约化"},{"source_term":"closed subscheme","target_term":"闭子概形"},{"source_term":"Noetherian","target_term":"诺特"},{"source_term":"induction","target_term":"归纳法"},{"source_term":"finite","target_term":"有限的"},{"source_term":"set","target_term":"集合"},{"source_term":"finite","target_term":"有限的"},{"source_term":"injective","target_term":"单射"},{"source_term":"set","target_term":"集合"},{"source_term":"morphisms","target_term":"态射"},{"source_term":"open","target_term":"开"},{"source_term":"open","target_term":"开"},{"source_term":"Morphisms","target_term":"态射"}],"unknown_terms":[{"source_term":"separated","target_term":"分离","context":"先证明的情形及有限态射；暂定待决。"},{"source_term":"Noetherian","target_term":"诺特","context":"有限分支及归纳条件；暂定待决。"},{"source_term":"connected components","target_term":"连通分支","context":"源概形的分支；暂定待决。"},{"source_term":"connected","target_term":"连通","context":"先归约到的情形；暂定待决。"},{"source_term":"image","target_term":"像","context":"点在底中的像；暂定待决。"},{"source_term":"unramified","target_term":"非分歧","context":"结构态射条件；暂定待决。"},{"source_term":"quasi-compact","target_term":"拟紧","context":"结构态射条件；暂定待决。"},{"source_term":"fibre","target_term":"纤维","context":"指定点上的纤维；暂定待决。"},{"source_term":"finite","target_term":"有限的","context":"集合和态射的有限性；暂定待决。"},{"source_term":"finite","target_term":"有限","context":"域扩张的有限性；暂定待决。"},{"source_term":"field","target_term":"域","context":"剩余域及初等域论；暂定待决。"},{"source_term":"extension","target_term":"扩张","context":"剩余域