{"unit_id":"tag:06ND:title","translation":"普遍（Universally）单射（injective）的非分歧（unramified）态射（morphisms）","allowed_english":[],"term_occurrences":[{"source_term":"Universally","target_term":"普遍"},{"source_term":"injective","target_term":"单射"},{"source_term":"unramified","target_term":"非分歧"},{"source_term":"morphisms","target_term":"态射"}],"unknown_terms":[{"source_term":"Universally","target_term":"普遍","context":"单射的普遍性；暂定待决。"},{"source_term":"injective","target_term":"单射","context":"本节态射的条件；暂定待决。"},{"source_term":"unramified","target_term":"非分歧","context":"本节态射的条件；暂定待决。"},{"source_term":"morphisms","target_term":"态射","context":"本节对象；暂定待决。"}],"notes":[]}
{"unit_id":"tag:06ND:prose-0001","translation":"\n\n<STRUCT_0001>\n回顾：概形（schemes）的态射（morphism）<MATH_0001>称为普遍（universally）单射（injective），如果<MATH_0002>的任意基变换（base change）都是单射（injective）（就底层拓扑空间（topological spaces）而言），见《态射（Morphisms）》篇，定义<REF_0001>。普遍（Universally）单射（injective）且非分歧（unramified）的态射（morphisms）可如下刻画。\n\n","allowed_english":[],"term_occurrences":[{"source_term":"schemes","target_term":"概形"},{"source_term":"morphism","target_term":"态射"},{"source_term":"universally","target_term":"普遍"},{"source_term":"injective","target_term":"单射"},{"source_term":"base change","target_term":"基变换"},{"source_term":"injective","target_term":"单射"},{"source_term":"topological spaces","target_term":"拓扑空间"},{"source_term":"Morphisms","target_term":"态射"},{"source_term":"Universally","target_term":"普遍"},{"source_term":"injective","target_term":"单射"},{"source_term":"unramified","target_term":"非分歧"},{"source_term":"morphisms","target_term":"态射"}],"unknown_terms":[{"source_term":"schemes","target_term":"概形","context":"态射的源和目标；暂定待决。"},{"source_term":"morphism","target_term":"态射","context":"被定义的态射；暂定待决。"},{"source_term":"universally","target_term":"普遍","context":"任意基变换后的性质；暂定待决。"},{"source_term":"injective","target_term":"单射","context":"底层空间上的单射；暂定待决。"},{"source_term":"base change","target_term":"基变换","context":"任意基变换；暂定待决。"},{"source_term":"topological spaces","target_term":"拓扑空间","context":"单射作用的底层空间；暂定待决。"},{"source_term":"Morphisms","target_term":"态射","context":"引用篇名；暂定待决。"},{"source_term":"Universally","target_term":"普遍","context":"最后一句的性质；暂定待决。"},{"source_term":"unramified","target_term":"非分歧","context":"待刻画的性质；暂定待决。"},{"source_term":"morphisms","target_term":"态射","context":"待刻画对象；暂定待决。"}],"notes":[]}
{"unit_id":"tag:05VH:statement","translation":"设<MATH_0001>为概形（schemes）的态射（morphism）。以下条件等价（equivalent）：\n<STRUCT_0001>\n<STRUCT_0002><MATH_0002>非分歧（unramified），且为单态射（monomorphism）；\n<STRUCT_0003><MATH_0003>非分歧（unramified），且为普遍（universally）单射（injective）；\n<STRUCT_0004><MATH_0004>局部有限型（locally of finite type），且为单态射（monomorphism）；\n<STRUCT_0005><MATH_0005>为普遍（universally）单射（injective）、局部有限型（locally of finite type）且形式非分歧（formally unramified）；\n<STRUCT_0006><MATH_0006>局部有限型（locally of finite type），且对所有<MATH_0009>，有如下二者之一：<MATH_0007>为空（empty），或<MATH_0008>为同构（isomorphism）。\n<STRUCT_0007>\n","allowed_english":[],"term_occurrences":[{"source_term":"schemes","target_term":"概形"},{"source_term":"morphism","target_term":"态射"},{"source_term":"equivalent","target_term":"等价"},{"source_term":"unramified","target_term":"非分歧"},{"source_term":"monomorphism","target_term":"单态射"},{"source_term":"unramified","target_term":"非分歧"},{"source_term":"universally","target_term":"普遍"},{"source_term":"injective","target_term":"单射"},{"source_term":"locally of finite type","target_term":"局部有限型"},{"source_term":"monomorphism","target_term":"单态射"},{"source_term":"universally","target_term":"普遍"},{"source_term":"injective","target_term":"单射"},{"source_term":"locally of finite type","target_term":"局部有限型"},{"source_term":"formally unramified","target_term":"形式非分歧"},{"source_term":"locally of finite type","target_term":"局部有限型"},{"source_term":"empty","target_term":"空"},{"source_term":"isomorphism","target_term":"同构"}],"unknown_terms":[{"source_term":"schemes","target_term":"概形","context":"态射两端；暂定待决。"},{"source_term":"morphism","target_term":"态射","context":"被刻画的态射；暂定待决。"},{"source_term":"equivalent","target_term":"等价","context":"五个条件；暂定待决。"},{"source_term":"unramified","target_term":"非分歧","context":"前两项；暂定待决。"},{"source_term":"monomorphism","target_term":"单态射","context":"第一、三项；暂定待决。"},{"source_term":"universally","target_term":"普遍","context":"任意基变换后的单射；暂定待决。"},{"source_term":"injective","target_term":"单射","context":"第二、四项；暂定待决。"},{"source_term":"locally of finite type","target_term":"局部有限型","context":"后三项；暂定待决。"},{"source_term":"formally unramified","target_term":"形式非分歧","context":"第四项；暂定待决。"},{"source_term":"empty","target_term":"空","context":"第五项的纤维；暂定待决。"},{"source_term":"isomorphism","target_term":"同构","context":"第五项的纤维映射；暂定待决。"}],"notes":[]}
{"unit_id":"tag:05VH:proof","translation":"我们已经在《态射（Morphisms）续篇》，引理<REF_0001>中看到，形式非分歧（formally unramified）且局部有限型（locally of finite type），与非分歧（unramified）是同一回事。因此(4)等价于（equivalent）(2)。单态射（monomorphism）当然是普遍（universally）单射（injective）且形式非分歧（formally unramified）的，所以(3)蕴含(4)。(1)显然蕴含(3)。最后，若(2)成立，则<MATH_0001>既是开浸入（open immersion）（《态射（Morphisms）》篇，引理<REF_0002>），又是满射（surjective）（《态射（Morphisms）》篇，引理<REF_0003>），因而为同构（isomorphism），即<MATH_0002>为单态射（monomorphism）。这样就得出(2)蕴含(1)。\n\n<STRUCT_0001><STRUCT_0002>\n条件(3)蕴含(5)，因为单态射（monomorphisms）在基变换（base change）下保持（《概形（Schemes）》篇，引理<REF_0004>），并且因为有对单态射（monomorphisms）的描述，即到域（fields）的谱（spectra）的这类映射的描述，见《概形（Schemes）》篇，引理<REF_0005>。由《态射（Morphisms）》篇，引理<REF_0006>及<REF_0007>，条件(5)蕴含(4)。\n","allowed_english":[],"term_occurrences":[{"source_term":"Morphisms","target_term":"态射"},{"source_term":"formally unramified","target_term":"形式非分歧"},{"source_term":"locally of finite type","target_term":"局部有限型"},{"source_term":"unramified","target_term":"非分歧"},{"source_term":"equivalent","target_term":"等价于"},{"source_term":"monomorphism","target_term":"单态射"},{"source_term":"universally","target_term":"普遍"},{"source_term":"injective","target_term":"单射"},{"source_term":"formally unramified","target_term":"形式非分歧"},{"source_term":"open immersion","target_term":"开浸入"},{"source_term":"Morphisms","target_term":"态射"},{"source_term":"surjective","target_term":"满射"},{"source_term":"Morphisms","target_term":"态射"},{"source_term":"isomorphism","target_term":"同构"},{"source_term":"monomorphism","target_term":"单态射"},{"source_term":"monomorphisms","target_term":"单态射"},{"source_term":"base change","target_term":"基变换"},{"source_term":"Schemes","target_term":"概形"},{"source_term":"monomorphisms","target_term":"单态射"},{"source_term":"fields","target_term":"域"},{"source_term":"spectra","target_term":"谱"},{"source_term":"Schemes","target_term":"概形"},{"source_term":"Morphisms","target_term":"态射"}],"unknown_terms":[{"source_term":"Morphisms","target_term":"态射","context":"引用篇名；暂定待决。"},{"source_term":"formally unramified","target_term":"形式非分歧","context":"与有限型条件结合；暂定待决。"},{"source_term":"locally of finite type","target_term":"局部有限型","context":"态射条件；暂定待决。"},{"source_term":"unramified","target_term":"非分歧","context":"两个条件的等价性质；暂定待决。"},{"source_term":"equivalent","target_term":"等价于","context":"条件(4)与(2)；暂定待决。"},{"source_term":"monomorphism","target_term":"单态射","context":"前半段性质；暂定待决。"},{"source_term":"universally","target_term":"普遍","context":"单射的普遍性；暂定待决。"},{"source_term":"injective","target_term":"单射","context":"单态射的性质；暂定待决。"},{"source_term":"open immersion","target_term":"开浸入","context":"对角态射性质；暂定待决。"},{"source_term":"surjective","target_term":"满射","context":"对角态射性质；暂定待决。"},{"source_term":"isomorphism","target_term":"同构","context":"对角态射结论；暂定待决。"},{"source_term":"monomorphisms","target_term":"单态射","context":"基变换及指向域的谱；暂定待决。"},{"source_term":"base change","target_term":"基变换","context":"保持单态射；暂定待决。"},{"source_term":"Schemes","target_term":"概形","context":"引用篇名；暂定待决。"},{"source_term":"fields","target_term":"域","context":"后半段的目标；暂定待决。"},{"source_term":"spectra","target_term":"谱","context":"域的谱；暂定待决。"}],"notes":[]}
