{"unit_id":"tag:04XV:statement","translation":"设<MATH_0001>为概形（schemes）的态射（morphism）。以下条件等价（equivalent）：\n<STRUCT_0001>\n<STRUCT_0002><MATH_0002>是闭浸入（closed immersion）；\n<STRUCT_0003><MATH_0003>是固有（proper）单态射（monomorphism）；\n<STRUCT_0004><MATH_0004>固有（proper）、非分歧（unramified），且为普遍（universally）单射（injective）；\n<STRUCT_0005><MATH_0005>普遍闭（universally closed）、非分歧（unramified），且为单态射（monomorphism）；\n<STRUCT_0006><MATH_0006>普遍闭（universally closed）、非分歧（unramified），且为普遍（universally）单射（injective）；\n<STRUCT_0007><MATH_0007>普遍闭（universally closed）、局部有限型（locally of finite type），且为单态射（monomorphism）；\n<STRUCT_0008><MATH_0008>普遍闭（universally closed），为普遍（universally）单射（injective）、局部有限型（locally of finite type）且形式非分歧（formally unramified）。\n<STRUCT_0009>\n","allowed_english":[],"term_occurrences":[{"source_term":"schemes","target_term":"概形"},{"source_term":"morphism","target_term":"态射"},{"source_term":"equivalent","target_term":"等价"},{"source_term":"closed immersion","target_term":"闭浸入"},{"source_term":"proper","target_term":"固有"},{"source_term":"monomorphism","target_term":"单态射"},{"source_term":"proper","target_term":"固有"},{"source_term":"unramified","target_term":"非分歧"},{"source_term":"universally","target_term":"普遍"},{"source_term":"injective","target_term":"单射"},{"source_term":"universally closed","target_term":"普遍闭"},{"source_term":"unramified","target_term":"非分歧"},{"source_term":"monomorphism","target_term":"单态射"},{"source_term":"universally closed","target_term":"普遍闭"},{"source_term":"unramified","target_term":"非分歧"},{"source_term":"universally","target_term":"普遍"},{"source_term":"injective","target_term":"单射"},{"source_term":"universally closed","target_term":"普遍闭"},{"source_term":"locally of finite type","target_term":"局部有限型"},{"source_term":"monomorphism","target_term":"单态射"},{"source_term":"universally closed","target_term":"普遍闭"},{"source_term":"universally","target_term":"普遍"},{"source_term":"injective","target_term":"单射"},{"source_term":"locally of finite type","target_term