{"unit_id":"tag:04XV:proof","translation":"(4)至(7)的等价性（equivalence）立即由引理<REF_0001>得到。\n\n<STRUCT_0001><STRUCT_0002>\n设<MATH_0001>满足(6)。则<MATH_0002>分离（separated），见《概形（Schemes）》篇，引理<REF_0002>，并具有有限（finite）纤维（fibres）。因此，《态射（Morphisms）续篇》，引理<REF_0003>表明<MATH_0003>是有限的（finite）。再由《态射（Morphisms）》篇，引理<REF_0004>可知<MATH_0004>是闭浸入（closed immersion），即(1)成立。\n\n<STRUCT_0003><STRUCT_0004>\n注意到(1)<MATH_0005>(2)，因为闭浸入（closed immersion）固有（proper）且为单态射（monomorphism）（《态射（Morphisms）》篇，引理<REF_0005>和《概形（Schemes）》篇，引理<REF_0006>）。由引理<REF_0007>可知，(2)蕴含(3)。(3)显然蕴含(5)。\n","allowed_english":[],"term_occurrences":[{"source_term":"equivalence","target_term":"等价性"},{"source_term":"separated","target_term":"分离"},{"source_term":"Schemes","target_term":"概形"},{"source_term":"finite","target_term":"有限"},{"source_term":"fibres","target_term":"纤维"},{"source_term":"Morphisms","target_term":"态射"},{"source_term":"finite","target_term":"有限的"},{"source_term":"Morphisms","target_term":"态射"},{"source_term":"closed immersion","target_term":"闭浸入"},{"source_term":"closed immersion","target_term":"闭浸入"},{"source_term":"proper","target_term":"固有"},{"source_term":"monomorphism","target_term":"单态射"},{"source_term":"Morphisms","target_term":"态射"},{"source_term":"Schemes","target_term":"概形"}],"unknown_terms":[{"source_term":"equivalence","target_term":"等价性","context":"最后四个条件；暂定待决。"},{"source_term":"separated","target_term":"分离","context":"单态射的性质；暂定待决。"},{"source_term":"Schemes","target_term":"概形","context":"引用篇名；暂定待决。"},{"source_term":"finite","target_term":"有限","context":"纤维的有限性；暂定待决。"},{"source_term":"fibres","target_term":"纤维","context":"源态射的纤维；暂定待决。"},{"source_term":"Morphisms","target_term":"态射","context":"引用篇名；暂定待决。"},{"source_term":"finite","target_term":"有限的","context":"态射的有限性；暂定待决。"},{"source_term":"closed immersion","target_term":"闭浸入","context":"待刻画性质；暂定待决。"},{"source_term":"proper","target_term":"固有","context":"闭浸入性质；暂定待决。"},{"source_term":"monomorphism","target_term":"单态射","context":"闭浸入性质；暂定待决。"}],"notes"