{"unit_id":"tag:04DG:statement","translation":"设<MATH_0001>为概形（schemes）的态射（morphism）。设<MATH_0002>。假设\n<STRUCT_0001>\n<STRUCT_0002><MATH_0003>是有限的（finite）；\n<STRUCT_0003><MATH_0004>非分歧（unramified）；\n<STRUCT_0004><MATH_0005>；\n<STRUCT_0005><MATH_0006>为纯不可分（purely inseparable）<FOOTNOTEOPEN_0001>鉴于条件(2)，这等价于（equivalent）<MATH_0007>。<FOOTNOTECLOSE_0001>。\n<STRUCT_0006>\n那么，存在开邻域（open neighbourhood）<MATH_0008>，是<MATH_0009>的邻域，使得<MATH_0010>是闭浸入（closed immersion）。\n","allowed_english":[],"term_occurrences":[{"source_term":"schemes","target_term":"概形"},{"source_term":"morphism","target_term":"态射"},{"source_term":"finite","target_term":"有限的"},{"source_term":"unramified","target_term":"非分歧"},{"source_term":"purely inseparable","target_term":"纯不可分"},{"source_term":"equivalent","target_term":"等价于"},{"source_term":"open neighbourhood","target_term":"开邻域"},{"source_term":"closed immersion","target_term":"闭浸入"}],"unknown_terms":[{"source_term":"schemes","target_term":"概形","context":"态射的两端；暂定待决。"},{"source_term":"morphism","target_term":"态射","context":"引理的态射；暂定待决。"},{"source_term":"finite","target_term":"有限的","context":"第一条件；暂定待决。"},{"source_term":"unramified","target_term":"非分歧","context":"第二条件；暂定待决。"},{"source_term":"purely inseparable","target_term":"纯不可分","context":"剩余域的扩张；暂定待决。"},{"source_term":"equivalent","target_term":"等价于","context":"脚注中的条件；暂定待决。"},{"source_term":"open neighbourhood","target_term":"开邻域","context":"结论的邻域；暂定待决。"},{"source_term":"closed immersion","target_term":"闭浸入","context":"限制态射的结论；暂定待决。"}],"notes":[]}
