{"unit_id":"tag:024X:statement","translation":"设<MATH_0001>为域（field）。非分歧（Unramified）拟紧（quasi-compact）态射（morphisms）<MATH_0002>是仿射的（affine）。这是因为<MATH_0003>的维数（dimension）为<MATH_0004>，且为诺特（Noetherian），因而是有限（finite）离散（discrete）集合（set），并且每一点都给出一个仿射开集（affine open）；所以<MATH_0005>是有限（finite）个仿射概形（affines）的不交并（disjoint union），从而是仿射的（affine）。Noether 正规化（Noether normalization）迫使<MATH_0006>为某个有限（finite）的<MATH_0007>代数（algebra）<MATH_0008>的谱（spectrum）。这个代数（algebra）是乘积（product），其各因子为<MATH_0009>的有限（finite）可分（separable）域（field）扩张（extensions）。因此，到<MATH_0010>的非分歧（unramified）拟紧（quasi-compact）态射（morphism）对应于有限（finite）多个有限（finite）可分（separable）域（field）扩张（extensions），它们扩张<MATH_0011>。特别地，非分歧（unramified）态射（morphism），若源连通（connected），且目标只有一个点，就必为有限（finite）可分（separable）域（field）扩张（extension）。我们稍后将看到，<MATH_0012>是平展（<ACCENT_0001>tale）的，当且仅当它是非分歧（unramified）的。因此，至少在这种情形下，概形（scheme）的平展（<ACCENT_0002>tale）拓扑（topology）有一个很容易的描述。当然，这个拓扑（topology）的上同调（cohomology）则是另一回事。\n","allowed_english":["Noether"],"term_occurrences":[{"source_term":"field","target_term":"域"},{"source_term":"Unramified","target_term":"非分歧"},{"source_term":"quasi-compact","target_term":"拟紧"},{"source_term":"morphisms","target_term":"态射"},{"source_term":"affine","target_term":"仿射的"},{"source_term":"dimension","target_term":"维数"},{"source_term":"Noetherian","target_term":"诺特"},{"source_term":"finite","target_term":"有限"},{"source_term":"discrete","target_term":"离散"},{"source_term":"set","target_term":"集合"},{"source_term":"affine open","target_term":"仿射开集"},{"source_term":"finite","target_term":"有限"},{"source_term":"affines","target_term":"仿射概形"},{"source_term":"disjoint union","target_term":"不交并"},{"source_term":"affine","target_term":"仿射的"},{"source_term":"Noether normalization","target_term":"Noether 正规化"},{"source_term":"finite","target_term":"有限"},{"source_term":"algebra","target_term":"代数"},{"source_term":"spectrum","target_term":"谱"},{"source_term":"algebra","target_term":"代数"},{"source_term":"product","target_term":"乘积"},{"source_term":"finite","target_term":"有限"},{"source_term":"separable","target_term":"可分"},{"source_term":"field","target_term":"域"},{"source_term":"extensions","target_term":"扩张"},{"source_term":"unramified","target_term":"非分歧"},{"source_term":"quasi-compact","target_term":"拟紧"},{"source_term":"morphism","target_term":"态射"},{"source_term":"finite","target_term":"有限"},{"source_term":"finite","target_term":"有限"},{"source_term":"separable","target_term":"可分"},{"source_term":"field","target_term":"域"},{"source_term":"extensions","target_term":"扩张"},{"source_term":"unramified","target_term":"非分歧"},{"source_term":"morphism","target_term":"态射"},{"source_term":"connected","target_term":"连通"},{"source_term":"finite","target_term":"有限"},{"source_term":"separable","target_term":"可分"},{"source_term":"field","target_term":"域"},{"source_term":"extension","target_term":"扩张"},{"source_term":"étale","target_term":"平展"},{"source_term":"unramified","target_term":"非分歧"},{"source_term":"scheme","target_term":"概形"},{"source_term":"étale","target_term":"平展"},{"source_term":"topology","target_term":"拓扑"},{"source_term":"topology","target_term":"拓扑"},{"source_term":"cohomology","target_term":"上同调"}],"unknown_terms":[{"source_term":"field","target_term":"域","context":"底域及扩张；暂定待决。"},{"source_term":"Unramified","target_term":"非分歧","context":"例子的态射条件；暂定待决。"},{"source_term":"quasi-compact","target_term":"拟紧","context":"例子的态射条件；暂定待决。"},{"source_term":"morphisms","target_term":"态射","context":"开头的态射；暂定待决。"},{"source_term":"affine","target_term":"仿射的","context":"所讨论的性质；暂定待决。"},{"source_term":"dimension","target_term":"维数","context":"源概形的维数；暂定待决。"},{"source_term":"Noetherian","target_term":"诺特","context":"源概形条件；暂定待决。"},{"source_term":"finite","target_term":"有限","context":"集合、并、代数及域扩张；暂定待决。"},{"source_term":"discrete","target_term":"离散","context":"源的底层集合；暂定待决。"},{"source_term":"set","target_term":"集合","context":"底层拓扑集合；暂定待决。"},{"source_term":"affine open","target_term":"仿射开集","context":"每个点给出的开集；暂定待决。"},{"source